Blocked on T-023 — pluggable OpenAPI → PHP name-normalisation strategies.

The DigitalOcean schema exposes two components whose names are not
valid PHP identifiers:

  - version-2
  - urn-2

The Profile's `renames` field (see paogen.php) is the intended escape
hatch per ADR-003, but is only consulted at `Generator::emitModels()`
and not in the other five ref-resolution sites. Once T-023 lands this
file gets deleted, the generator runs, and `generated/` is committed.
